{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BbJ9tBxWfcz3ykw5PSL2KY","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1: 条件性断言 — \"depth estimation is feasible and accurate at\n2\t  1–1.5B (70–85%);\n3\t\n4\t  the signal persists at 14B (~67%) with ~13pp attenuation, and under prompted generation\n5\t\n6\t  (~67%) with ~16pp attenuation, indicating scale- and mode-dependent signal reduction\n7\t\n8\t  that warrants further investigation.\" Headline: \"70–85% at 1–1.5B; signal persists\n9\t\n10\t  at 14B (62–72%) and under topic-seeded generation (58–70%).\"\n11\t\n12\t\n13\t  Claim 2: Atlas 9-cell 核心不变。14B 数据点扩展 scale 维度，EDD 从 1B 的 3–4 降至 14B\n14\t\n15\t  的 2（T=0.75），引入 scale-dependent EDD 概念——更大模型更快收敛到 attractor distribution。\n16\t\n17\t\n18\t  Claim 3: 完全 reframe — \"we validate the two-stage decomposition principle: oracle\n19\t\n20\t  two-stage (78.4%) recovers within-strategy performance (78.2%), confirming strategy\n21\t\n22\t  conditioning as the theoretically correct approach. Strategy identification from\n23\t  depth\n24\t\n25\t  features alone is the practical bottleneck (57.5%), and naive multi-strategy pooling\n26\t\n27\t  (72.0%) serves as a strong zero-cost baseline improving from 59.1%.\"\n28\t\n29\t\n30\t  EMNLP Main: \"New Missions\" track — task formalization + comprehensive Atlas + scale/mode\n31\t\n32\t  robustness evidence (both positive AND honest attenuation reporting) + identified\n33\t  open\n34\t\n35\t  challenges (strategy identification, prompted SNR, scale-dependent EDD).\n36\t\n37\t  '\n38\timagined_experiments:\n39\t- name: DCOL Component Ablation (Cancelled)\n40\t  plan_id: plan_010\n41\t  description: 'DCOL v6 各组件消融（attractive loss / repulsive loss / margin schedule /\n42\t    embedding pooling）。前置依赖 plan_004 结论为 negative（test 64.5% vs RF 78.2%），实验取消。\n43\t\n44\t    '\n45\t  expected_results:\n46\t    status: cancelled\n47\t    reason: plan_004 (DCOL v6) negative — test_acc=64.5%, severe overfitting, 前置条件不满足\n48\t    hypothetical_if_run:\n49\t      attractive_only_acc: 0.58\n50\t      repulsive_only_acc: 0.52\n51\t      no_margin_schedule_acc: 0.61\n52\t      full_model_acc: 0.645\n53\t      best_ablation_vs_rf_gap_pp: -12\n54\t      all_variants_overfit: true\n55\t  result_rationale: 'DCOL 的根本失败是 representation bottleneck：RoBERTa-large [CLS] embedding\n56\t    编码语义\n57\t\n58\t    内容而非 distributional depth signal。消融任一组件不改变此限制。attractive-only 去除\n59\t\n60\t    inter-class repulsion → embedding collapse（v1-v3 已验证此模式）；repulsive-only 丧失\n61\t\n62\t    ordinal structure → 退化为普通多类对比；no-margin-schedule 移除课程学习但 representation\n63\t\n64\t    quality 不变。所有变体均会在 train 75% vs val ~60-64% 处表现出严重过拟合——模型学到\n65\t\n66\t    training set 表面模式而非 generalizable depth signal。\n67\t\n68\t    '\n69\t  tables: []\n70\t  figures_description: []\n71\t  analysis: '取消不影响论文。DCOL v6 negative result 纳入 Discussion 作为 \"contrastive ordinal\n72\t    learning on text depth estimation 的固有局限\" 分析，增加论文诚实度。消融细节不需要。\n73\t\n74\t    '\n75\t- name: 13B Clean FP16 Scale Validation\n76\t  plan_id: plan_014\n77\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-14B FP16 + LoRA（无量化），nucleus p=0.95，d0-d3 递归链，19 特征提取 + RF/LR\n78\t    分类。Pythia-410M 作为 reference model。验证 depth signal 在主流规模是否持续。\n79\t\n80\t    '\n81\t  expected_results:\n82\t    data:\n83\t      model: Qwen2.5-14B\n84\t      precision: FP16\n85\t      quantization: none\n86\t      strategy: nucleus_p095\n87\t      depths: 4\n88\t      samples_per_depth: 5000\n89\t      reference_model: Pythia-410M\n90\t      feature_dim: 19\n91\t      truncation_length: 498\n92\t    four_class:\n93\t      rf_accuracy: 0.67\n94\t      rf_accuracy_ci:\n95\t      - 0.655\n96\t      - 0.685\n97\t      lr_accuracy: 0.63\n98\t      lr_accuracy_ci:\n99\t      - 0.614\n100\t      - 0.646\n101\t      mae: 0.38\n102\t    pairwise_auc:\n103\t      d0v1: 0.97\n104\t      d0v2: 0.985\n105\t      d0v3: 0.99\n106\t      d1v2: 0.76\n107\t      d1v3: 0.92\n108\t      d2v3: 0.7\n109\t    three_class:\n110\t      rf_accuracy: 0.57\n111\t      rf_accuracy_ci:\n112\t      - 0.552\n113\t      - 0.588\n114\t      auc:\n115\t        d1v2: 0.75\n116\t        d1v3: 0.91\n117\t        d2v3: 0.69\n118\t    per_class:\n119\t      d0:\n120\t        recall: 0.96\n121\t        precision: 0.88\n122\t        f1: 0.92\n123\t      d1:\n124\t        recall: 0.68\n125\t        precision: 0.62\n126\t        f1: 0.65\n127\t      d2:\n128\t        recall: 0.42\n129\t        precision: 0.52\n130\t        f1: 0.46\n131\t      d3:\n132\t        recall: 0.62\n133\t        precision: 0.7\n134\t        f1: 0.66\n135\t    edd_sensitivity:\n136\t      T_080: 1\n137\t      T_075: 2\n138\t      T_070: 3\n139\t      T_065: 3\n140\t    top_features:\n141\t      rank_1: p90_ppl\n142\t      rank_2: mean_ppl\n143\t      rank_3: var_surprisal\n144\t      rank_4: p75_ppl\n145\t      rank_5: mean_surprisal\n146\t    feature_universality:\n147\t      p90_ppl_in_top2: true\n148\t      var_surprisal_in_top2: false\n149\t      var_surprisal_in_top4: true\n150\t      both_in_top5: true\n151\t    finetune_losses:\n152\t      depth_0: 1.65\n153\t      depth_1: 1.15\n154\t      depth_2: 0.9\n155\t    code_contamination:\n156\t      d0: 0.003\n157\t      d1: 0.015\n158\t      d2: 0.022\n159\t      d3: 0.028\n160\t    scale_comparison:\n161\t      vs_1b_mean_nucleus_acc_delta_pp: -13.1\n162\t      vs_1b_mean_d1v2_auc_delta: -0.12\n163\t      vs_1b_edd_delta: -2 (from 3-4 to 2 at T=0.75)\n164\t  result_rationale: '**4-class 67% (1B mean ~80%, Δ=-13pp)**:\n165\t\n166\t    14B 语言建模能力远超 1B，每次递归 fine-tune 产生的 distributional shift 更小。\n167\t\n168\t    14B 模型的 loss landscape 更平滑——同等 LoRA rank 的参数扰动对 14B output 分布的\n169\t\n170\t    影响被 14B 的大参数量\"稀释\"。结果是 d1 文本的 statistical properties 更接近 d0，\n171\t\n172\t    d1/d2/d3 在 feature space 中更紧凑。67% 仍远超 chance (25%)——信号存在但被压缩。\n173\t\n174\t\n175\t    **d1v2 AUC 0.76 (1B mean ~0.88, Δ=-0.12)**:\n176\t\n177\t    d1→d2 是最关键的难点对。14B 模型在 d1 数据上 fine-tune 时，大容量让模型能\"吸收\"\n178\t\n179\t    训练数据变化而不显著改变生成行为——14B 有足够参数分配给 d1 分布的细微特征，同时保持\n180\t\n181\t    整体生成质量不变。这压缩了 d1/d2 feature space 间距。但 AUC>0.70 说明 boundary\n182\t\n183\t    仍然存在，不是随机水平。\n184\t\n185\t\n186\t    **EDD=2 at T=0.75 (1B EDD=3-4)**:\n187\t\n188\t    这是最重要的 scale finding。14B 加速收敛到 attractor distribution：1B 模型需 3-4\n189\t\n190\t    次递归才到不可区分边界，14B 仅需 2 次。机制：更大模型的 attractor basin 更宽且\n191\t\n192\t    收敛梯度更陡，每步递归消除更大比例的 non-attractor distributional structure。\n193\t\n194\t    d2v3 AUC=0.70 恰在 T=0.75 下方——d2 和 d3 在 14B 上已几乎不可区分。\n195\t\n196\t    T=0.70 时 EDD=3 提供了对 threshold sensitivity 的有效展示。\n197\t\n198\t\n199\t    **var_surprisal 从 rank 1-2 降至 rank 3**:\n200\t\n201\t    14B 生成文本在 token-level surprisal 上天然更一致（低方差），depth 间的 variance\n202\t\n203\t    差异被压缩。相比之下，p90_ppl 保持 top-2——极端 token 的 perplexity 在递归中\n204\t\n205\t    仍有可检测变化，因为即使 14B 也有 tail tokens 受递归 fine-tune 影响。mean_ppl\n206\t\n207\t    上升到 rank 2 因为 14B 文本的整体 perplexity 水平对 depth 的敏感度相对增强——\n208\t\n209\t    当 variance signal 被压缩时，mean level 成为主要鉴别器。\n210\t\n211\t\n212\t    **Finetune losses 更低且间距更小 (d0=1.65→d1=1.15→d2=0.90)**:\n213\t\n214\t    14B 在原始数据上 loss 就更低（更好的 language model），递归间 loss drop 也更小\n215\t\n216\t    (Δd0d1=-0.50 vs 1B typical -0.60~-0.85)。这直接证实 distributional shift 被压缩。\n217\t\n218\t\n219\t    **Pythia reference model 区分力衰减**:\n220\t\n221\t    Pythia-410M 看到的 14B 各 depth 输出的 perplexity 分布更接近 d0（因为 14B 生成\n222\t\n223\t    质量全面更接近 human text），depth 间的 feature distance 在 Pythia 视角下被压缩。\n224\t\n225\t    但 relative ordering 保持——d0<d1<d2<d3 in p90_ppl 的单调趋势仍在，只是间距变窄。\n226\t\n227\t    '\n228\t  tables:\n229\t  - 'Table: Scale Comparison — 3 个 1B 模型 (nucleus) vs 14B 的 4-class accuracy, d1v2/d2v3\n230\t    AUC, EDD'\n231\t  - 'Table: EDD Sensitivity — T=0.65/0.70/0.75/0.80 下的 EDD 值，1B (3 models) vs 14B'\n232\t  - 'Table: Feature Importance Ranking — 1B pooled vs 14B，标注 rank shift'\n233\t  - 'Table: Per-class Precision/Recall/F1 — 14B vs 1B best (GPT-2 XL nucleus)'\n234\t  figures_description:\n235\t  - 'AUC decay curve: 3 条 1B 实线 + 1 条 14B 虚线。14B 线在 d1v2 处急剧下降，视觉化 scale-dependent\n236\t    attenuation。加 EDD threshold 横线 (T=0.75)。'\n237\t  - 'Confusion matrix heatmap pair: 14B (left) vs GPT-2 XL 1.5B (right)。14B 的 d1/d2\n238\t    混淆区域显著扩大。'\n239\t  - 'Feature importance bar chart: grouped bars (1B mean vs 14B)，标注 var_surprisal\n240\t    rank shift (2→3) 和 mean_ppl rank shift (3-5→2)。'\n241\t  analysis: '13B 结果是 median 叙事的核心支柱：signal persists with quantified attenuation。\n242\t\n243\t\n244\t    对 Claim 1: \"at 1–1.5B, four-class accuracy reaches 70–85%; at 14B clean FP16,\n245\t\n246\t    accuracy is 67% (Δ≈−13pp), demonstrating that the depth signal persists at\n247\t\n248\t    mainstream model scale but with reduced discriminability.\" 不再说 \"robust across\n249\t\n250\t    scales\"，改为 \"signal persists with scale-dependent attenuation.\"\n251\t\n252\t\n253\t    对 Claim 2 (Atlas): EDD scale-dependence (1B: 3-4, 14B: 2) 是独立 finding。\n254\t\n255\t    写入 Atlas section 作为 \"scale extension panel\"。EDD 公式从 EDD(M, S, T) 扩展为\n256\t\n257\t    EDD(M, S, T, |θ|)——depth boundary 是 model size 的函数。\n258\t\n259\t\n260\t    对 Reviewer concern \"only tested on small models\": 直接回应——14B clean FP16\n261\t\n262\t    实验确认信号存在，衰减幅度精确量化。这比 \"signal disappears at scale\" 或\n263\t\n264\t    \"signal is identical at scale\" 都更 informative 且更诚实。\n265\t\n266\t\n267\t    Feature universality claim 需限定: \"p90_ppl and var_surprisal consistently appear\n268\t\n269\t    in the top-5 across all settings including 14B, though their relative ranking\n270\t\n271\t    shifts at larger scale (var_surprisal drops from top-2 to top-4 at 14B).\"\n272\t\n273\t    '\n274\t- name: Wild-data Calibration on RedPajama/Dolma\n275\t  plan_id: plan_015\n276\t  description: '在 RedPajama 和 Dolma 上运行已训练的 depth classifier，评估 FPR 和跨语料一致性。 已延后到\n277\t    AAAI 窗口，不阻塞 EMNLP 投稿。\n278\t\n279\t    '\n280\t  expected_results:\n281\t    status: deferred_to_aaai\n282\t    redpajama:\n283\t      n_passages: 5000\n284\t      d0_pct: 80.0\n285\t      d1_pct: 15.2\n286\t      d2_pct: 3.3\n287\t      d3_pct: 1.5\n288\t      fpr: 20.0\n289\t      mean_p_d0: 0.78\n290\t    dolma:\n291\t      n_passages: 5000\n292\t      d0_pct: 85.0\n293\t      d1_pct: 11.0\n294\t      d2_pct: 2.5\n295\t      d3_pct: 1.5\n296\t      fpr: 15.0\n297\t      mean_p_d0: 0.82\n298\t      per_source_fpr:\n299\t        wiki_subset: 1.0\n300\t        academic_subset: 3.0\n301\t        books_subset: 2.0\n302\t        web_subset: 20.0\n303\t    cross_corpus_pattern:\n304\t      editorial_fpr_range: 0–3%\n305\t      curated_web_fpr_range: 12–18%\n306\t      raw_webcrawl_fpr_range: 18–22%\n307\t      six_corpus_summary: FPR 由内容质量驱动，非 dataset-specific artifact\n308\t  result_rationale: '**RedPajama FPR ~20%**: RedPajama-v2 与 C4 同为 Common Crawl 子集\n309\t    + 质量过滤，数据\n310\t\n311\t    组成高度重叠。已有三个 web-crawl 数据集 FPR 一致 (C4=20.2%, FineWeb=19.5%,\n312\t\n313\t    RedPajama_sample≈20%)，表明 ~20% 是 web-crawl 内容中 template/SEO/boilerplate 的\n314\t\n315\t    固有比例——这些文本的高重复率和低词汇多样性使其 feature profile 酷似 d1+ 生成文本。\n316\t\n317\t\n318\t    **Dolma FPR ~15%**: Dolma 由 AI2 策划，包含高质量子集（Wikipedia, books, academic\n319\t\n320\t    papers）和 web 子集。Wikipedia 类内容 FPR ≈ 0% (WikiText 验证), academic/books 约\n321\t\n322\t    2-3%，web 子集约 20%。混合后整体 ~15%，低于纯 web-crawl 但高于纯 editorial。\n323\t\n324\t\n325\t    **Cross-corpus 一致性**: 4 个已有数据点已建立清晰模式——FPR 与数据质量强相关，与数据\n326\t\n327\t    来源弱相关。RedPajama/Dolma 不会打破此规律，只会增加模式的统计确信度。\n328\t\n329\t    '\n330\t  tables:\n331\t  - 'Table (Appendix): FPR across 6+ corpora — WikiText/OpenWebText/C4/FineWeb/RedPajama/Dolma，按质量层级排列'\n332\t  figures_description:\n333\t  - 'Bar chart: FPR by corpus, 分三组 (editorial ≤3% / curated-web 12-18% / raw-web-crawl\n334\t    18-22%)'\n335\t  analysis: '延后不影响 EMNLP。当前 4 个数据点 (WikiText 0% / OpenWebText ~1-3% / C4 ~20% /\n336\t\n337\t    FineWeb ~19.5%) 已足够支撑 \"FPR is content-quality-driven\" 论述。\n338\t\n339\t    RedPajama/Dolma 增加密度但不改变结论。AAAI 版本可加入作为 extended analysis。\n340\t\n341\t    '\n342\t- name: Prompted Generation Ecological Validity\n343\t  plan_id: plan_016\n344\t  description: 'GPT-2 XL topic-seeded d0-d3 递归链。用 ~10 个 topic prompt 前缀替代 BOS 无条件生成，\n345\t    验证 depth signal 是否为无条件生成的 artifact。d0 = base GPT-2 XL 有 prompt 生成， d1-d3 = 递归\n346\t    LoRA fine-tune 后有 prompt 生成。Pythia-410M 为 reference model。\n347\t\n348\t    '\n349\t  expected_results:\n350\t    data:\n351\t      model: GPT-2 XL (1.5B)\n352\t      strategy: nucleus_p095\n353\t      generation_mode: topic-seeded\n354\t      prompt_templates: 10\n355\t      depths: 4\n356\t      samples_per_depth: 5000\n357\t      reference_model: Pythia-410M\n358\t    four_class:\n359\t      rf_accuracy: 0.67\n360\t      rf_accuracy_ci:\n361\t      - 0.654\n362\t      - 0.686\n363\t      lr_accuracy: 0.62\n364\t      lr_accuracy_ci:\n365\t      - 0.603\n366\t      - 0.637\n367\t      mae: 0.37\n368\t    pairwise_auc:\n369\t      d0v1: 0.98\n370\t      d0v2: 0.993\n371\t      d0v3: 0.997\n372\t      d1v2: 0.76\n373\t      d1v3: 0.94\n374\t      d2v3: 0.72\n375\t    three_class:\n376\t      rf_accuracy: 0.58\n377\t      rf_accuracy_ci:\n378\t      - 0.561\n379\t      - 0.599\n380\t      auc:\n381\t        d1v2: 0.75\n382\t        d1v3: 0.93\n383\t        d2v3: 0.71\n384\t    per_class:\n385\t      d0:\n386\t        recall: 0.95\n387\t        precision: 0.88\n388\t        f1: 0.91\n389\t      d1:\n390\t        recall: 0.7\n391\t        precision: 0.64\n392\t        f1: 0.67\n393\t      d2:\n394\t        recall: 0.45\n395\t        precision: 0.5\n396\t        f1: 0.47\n397\t      d3:\n398\t        recall: 0.58\n399\t        precision: 0.68\n400\t        f1: 0.63\n401\t    retention_vs_bos:\n402\t      bos_baseline_acc: 0.833\n403\t      prompted_acc: 0.67\n404\t      retention_pct: 80.4\n405\t      bos_d1v2_auc: 0.913\n406\t      prompted_d1v2_auc: 0.76\n407\t      d1v2_retention_pct: 83.2\n408\t      bos_d2v3_auc: 0.883\n409\t      prompted_d2v3_auc: 0.72\n410\t      d2v3_retention_pct: 81.5\n411\t    edd_at_075: 2\n412\t    top_features:\n413\t      rank_1: p90_ppl\n414\t      rank_2: var_surprisal\n415\t      rank_3: p75_ppl\n416\t      rank_4: mean_ppl\n417\t      rank_5: mean_surprisal\n418\t    feature_importance_vs_bos:\n419\t      p90_ppl_weight_ratio: 0.85\n420\t      var_surprisal_weight_ratio: 0.78\n421\t      ranking_preserved: true\n422\t      importance_uniformly_attenuated: true\n423\t    finetune_losses:\n424\t      depth_0: 2.3\n425\t      depth_1: 1.55\n426\t      depth_2: 1.2\n427\t    code_contamination:\n428\t      d0: 0.001\n429\t      d1: 0.008\n430\t      d2: 0.015\n431\t      d3: 0.02\n432\t  result_rationale: '**4-class 67% (BOS 83.3%, Δ=-16.3pp, retention 80%)**:\n433\t\n434\t    Topic seed 引入内容先验，约束了模型生成的词汇和主题范围。BOS 模式下，不同 depth\n435\t\n436\t    的文本在 topic coverage、lexical diversity 上差异显著（depth↑ → topic collapse →\n437\t\n438\t    TTR 下降）。Topic-seeded 模式下所有 depth 都围绕指定主题生成，topic collapse 信号\n439\t\n440\t    被部分掩盖，词汇多样性差异缩小。\n441\t\n442\t\n443\t    但 80% retention 揭示信号的主要来源不是 topic-level diversity 而是 token-level\n444\t\n445\t    distributional shift：prompt 约束了\"说什么\"但不约束\"怎么说\"——递归 fine-tune\n446\t\n447\t    改变的是模型的 logit distribution over tokens，这在任何生成模式下都会发生。\n448\t\n449\t    p90_ppl 和 var_surprisal 捕获的正是这种 token-level 变化。\n450\t\n451\t\n452\t    **d1v2 AUC 0.76 (BOS 0.913, Δ=-0.153)**:\n453\t\n454\t    Topic prompt 充当 regularizer：conditioned generation 使 fine-tune 后模型在\n455\t\n456\t    topic-relevant context 中的行为更接近 pre-tune 模型（prompt 约束减少了 generation\n457\t\n458\t    自由度，限制了 distributional shift 的表达空间）。d1/d2 的 feature space 间距\n459\t\n460\t    缩小，但 AUC>0.65 说明 boundary 仍 detectable，不是 noise。\n461\t\n462\t\n463\t    **Feature ranking 保持 (p90_ppl > var_surprisal)**:\n464\t\n465\t    Perplexity tail statistics 是最 mode-robust 的 depth marker。Topic prompt 降低了\n466\t\n467\t    所有 depth 的 overall generation variance，但 tail events（extreme tokens）的\n468\t\n469\t    depth-dependent behavior 难以被 topic constraint 完全消除——即使在受限主题内，\n470\t\n471\t    递归 fine-tune 仍改变模型对 low-frequency tokens 的概率分配。Importance weights\n472\t\n473\t    整体下降约 15-22%（与 accuracy drop 一致），但 rank ordering 稳定。\n474\t\n475\t\n476\t    **Feature importance attenuation 但非 collapse (weight ratio 0.78-0.85)**:\n477\t\n478\t    说明 topic prompt 均匀压缩了所有 depth features 的区分力，而非选择性消除某些\n479\t\n480\t    features。这支持 \"same underlying signal, different SNR\" 的叙事——BOS 和 prompted\n481\t\n482\t    共享同一 depth signal，只是 prompted 的 signal-to-noise ratio 更低。\n483\t\n484\t\n485\t    **EDD=2 at T=0.75**:\n486\t\n487\t    Prompted 模式下 d2/d3 变得难以区分。机制与 13B 不同——不是模型容量导致的快速收敛，\n488\t\n489\t    而是 topic constraint 压缩了 feature space 中 d2/d3 微弱差异的可见度。两个独立\n490\t\n491\t    原因（scale 和 mode）导致相同 EDD=2，是巧合而非因果关联。\n492\t\n493\t\n494\t    **Finetune losses (d0=2.30, d1=1.55, d2=1.20)**:\n495\t\n496\t    d0 loss 比 BOS (2.55) 略低：topic-seeded text 更结构化、更可预测。但 depth 间\n497\t\n498\t    loss gap 模式保持 (d0-d1=-0.75, d1-d2=-0.35)，说明递归 degradation 的基本\n499\t\n500\t    dynamics 不受 generation mode 影响。\n501\t\n502\t\n503\t    **Code contamination 极低 (<2%)**:\n504\t\n505\t    Topic-seeded 生成约束内容为自然语言主题（\"The following article discusses...\"等），\n506\t\n507\t    几乎不产生代码。低于 BOS 模式的 code contamination。\n508\t\n509\t    '\n510\t  tables:\n511\t  - 'Table: BOS vs Prompted — 4-class accuracy, d1v2/d2v3 AUC, retention rates'\n512\t  - 'Table: Per-class Recall/Precision/F1 — BOS vs Prompted side-by-side'\n513\t  - 'Table: Feature importance ranking + weights — BOS vs Prompted, with attenuation\n514\t    ratio'\n515\t  figures_description:\n516\t  - 'Paired bar chart: BOS vs Prompted per-metric (acc, d1v2 AUC, d2v3 AUC)，每对 bars\n517\t    上方标注 retention %'\n518\t  - 'Feature trajectory panel: top-5 features × depth, BOS (solid line) vs Prompted\n519\t    (dashed line)，展示平行衰减 + 幅度压缩'\n520\t  analysis: 'Prompted 实验提供 \"partial ecological validation\":\n521\t\n522\t    - 67% > 25% (chance) → 信号不是 BOS artifact\n523\t\n524\t    - 80% retention → 信号大部分保留\n525\t\n526\t    - Feature ranking 不变 → 同一底层 signal，不同 SNR\n527\t\n528\t\n529\t    对 Claim 1: \"under prompted (topic-seeded) generation, depth estimation retains\n530\t\n531\t    ~80% of BOS baseline accuracy (67% vs 83.3%), confirming the depth signal\n532\t\n533\t    reflects genuine distributional shifts from recursive fine-tuning rather than\n534\t\n535\t    an artifact of unconditional generation mode.\"\n536\t\n537\t\n538\t    对 Reviewer concern \"artifact of BOS\": 直接回应——67% far above chance, signal\n539\t\n540\t    exists under realistic conditions. 但需诚实报告 16pp gap 并写入 Limitations:\n541\t\n542\t    \"prompted generation attenuates the signal; whether prompt diversity, longer\n543\t\n544\t    generation, or alternative prompt strategies could recover accuracy remains open.\"\n545\t\n546\t\n547\t    Key narrative: \"BOS-seeded and topic-seeded generation share the same underlying\n548\t\n549\t    depth signal with different SNR — the signal arises from recursive fine-tuning\n550\t\n551\t    dynamics, not from generation mode artifacts.\"\n552\t\n553\t    '\n554\t- name: Cross-Strategy Two-Stage Pipeline\n555\t  plan_id: plan_017\n556\t  description: '两阶段方案：(a) 策略识别分类器（19 features → 3-class: nucleus/temp09/topk50）， (b)\n557\t    策略条件深度分类器（识别后用策略专属 RF）。含 oracle two-stage / naive pooled / within-strategy 对照。\n558\t\n559\t    '\n560\t  expected_results:\n561\t    strategy_classification:\n562\t      mean_acc: 0.575\n563\t      chance: 0.333\n564\t      pythia:\n565\t        acc: 0.523\n566\t        per_strategy_recall:\n567\t          nucleus: 0.533\n568\t          temp09: 0.414\n569\t          topk50: 0.622\n570\t      olmo:\n571\t        acc: 0.548\n572\t        per_strategy_recall:\n573\t          nucleus: 0.608\n574\t          temp09: 0.479\n575\t          topk50: 0.558\n576\t      gpt2xl:\n577\t        acc: 0.654\n578\t        per_strategy_recall:\n579\t          nucleus: 0.845\n580\t          temp09: 0.507\n581\t          topk50: 0.61\n582\t      confusion_pattern: nucleus/topk50 互混最严重（均为 truncation-based），temp09 相对可区分但 recall\n583\t        仍低于 60%\n584\t    depth_estimation_ladder:\n585\t      cross_strategy_loo_ref: 0.591\n586\t      naive_pooled:\n587\t        pythia: 0.709\n588\t        olmo: 0.712\n589\t        gpt2xl: 0.739\n590\t        mean: 0.72\n591\t      predicted_two_stage:\n592\t        pythia: 0.693\n593\t        olmo: 0.695\n594\t        gpt2xl: 0.73\n595\t        mean: 0.706\n596\t      oracle_two_stage:\n597\t        pythia: 0.746\n598\t        olmo: 0.785\n599\t        gpt2xl: 0.82\n600\t        mean: 0.784\n601\t      within_strategy_ref:\n602\t        pythia: 0.745\n603\t        olmo: 0.784\n604\t        gpt2xl: 0.816\n605\t        mean: 0.782\n606\t    key_gaps_pp:\n607\t      oracle_vs_within: 0.2\n608\t      predicted_vs_naive: -1.4\n609\t      predicted_vs_oracle: -7.8\n610\t      naive_vs_cross_loo: 12.9\n611\t    strategy_clf_breakeven_estimate: 65-70% strategy accuracy needed for two-stage\n612\t      > naive pooled\n613\t  result_rationale: '**策略分类 57.5% (预期 >90% 未达成)**:\n614\t\n615\t    原始预期基于 \"三种策略的 feature distribution 高度可分\" 的假设——此假设错误。\n616\t\n617\t    19 个 features 主要编码 depth signal 而非 strategy signal：p90_ppl 和 var_surprisal\n618\t\n619\t    的值主要由 depth 决定，strategy 效应是二阶效应。\n620\t\n621\t\n622\t    具体原因：nucleus p=0.95 和 topk k=50 都是 truncation-based sampling，两者截断\n623\t\n624\t    低概率 token 来控制质量，产生高度相似的 feature distribution。只有 temp09（uniform\n625\t\n626\t    logit scaling 而非截断）产生显著不同的 feature profile。但 temp09 的区分性集中在\n627\t\n628\t    d1-d2 boundary 附近（即 d1v2 AUC 反转现象），在 d0 和 d3 处三种策略的 feature\n629\t\n630\t    values 收敛（d0 是 real text → strategy-independent，d3 已深度退化 → 策略差异被\n631\t\n632\t    attractor convergence 淹没）。\n633\t\n634\t\n635\t    GPT-2 XL 策略分类最优 (65.4%)：GPT-2 XL 的 strategy-feature interaction 最强\n636\t\n637\t    (d1v2 AUC: nucleus 0.913 vs temp09 0.937 → 跨策略差异最显著)。Pythia 最差 (52.3%)\n638\t\n639\t    因为其三种策略 feature distribution 最接近。\n640\t\n641\t\n642\t    **Oracle two-stage (78.4%) ≈ within-strategy (78.2%), gap=0.2pp**:\n643\t\n644\t    最重要的理论验证。当策略已知时，strategy-conditioned classifier 完美恢复\n645\t\n646\t    within-strategy 性能，0.2pp 在统计误差内。这证明 cross-strategy accuracy drop\n647\t\n648\t    (78.2% → 59.1% = -19.1pp) 完全由 strategy mismatch 驱动，无其他 confound。\n649\t\n650\t    Two-stage decomposition 在理论上是完全正确的分解。\n651\t\n652\t\n653\t    **Predicted two-stage (70.6%) < naive pooled (72.0%), Δ=-1.4pp**:\n654\t\n655\t    策略分类器 57.5% 意味着 ~42.5% 样本被路由到错误的 strategy-conditioned classifier。\n656\t\n657\t    错误路由的损害大于正确路由的收益——被错误分配到 temp09 classifier 的 nucleus 样本\n658\t\n659\t    会遭遇 d1v2 boundary 反转（AUC<0.20），产生系统性误分类。Naive pooled 通过在\n660\t\n661\t    全部训练数据上训练单一 RF 来\"平均化\"策略差异，避免了路由错误，反而更稳定。\n662\t\n663\t\n664\t    **Naive pooled (72.0%) vs cross-LOO (59.1%), Δ=+12.9pp**:\n665\t\n666\t    Pooled 至少见过所有策略的训练数据，相当于 \"strategy-agnostic\" method。LOO 完全\n667\t\n668\t    没有 holdout strategy 的数据，尤其在 temp09-holdout 场景下遭遇灾难性的 d1v2 反转。\n669\t\n670\t    +12.9pp 说明\"简单池化\"是一个 strong, zero-cost baseline。\n671\t\n672\t\n673\t    **Breakeven 估计 65-70%**:\n674\t\n675\t    当策略分类 accuracy 超过 ~65-70% 时，正确路由的收益开始超过错误路由的损害。这是\n676\t\n677\t    因为正确路由到 within-strategy classifier 的样本每个贡献 +6pp (78.2% - 72.0%)\n678\t\n679\t    的潜在增益，而错误路由平均贡献 -13pp 的损害 (72.0% - 59.1%)。在 p(correct)\n680\t\n681\t    × 6 > p(error) × 13 即 p>0.68 时，two-stage 优于 pooled。\n682\t\n683\t    '\n684\t  tables:\n685\t  - 'Table: Strategy Classification — per-model accuracy + per-strategy recall + confusion\n686\t    matrix'\n687\t  - 'Table: Depth Estimation Accuracy Ladder — 5 conditions (LOO 59.1% → Pooled 72.0%\n688\t    → Predicted 70.6% → Oracle 78.4% → Within 78.2%) per model + mean'\n689\t  - 'Table: Gap Analysis — oracle-within, predicted-pooled, predicted-oracle, pooled-LOO,\n690\t    with interpretation'\n691\t  figures_description:\n692\t  - 'Accuracy ladder bar chart: 5 bars 从左到右 (LOO → Pooled → Predicted → Oracle → Within)，用括号标注\n693\t    key gaps。Oracle/Within 几乎等高是视觉 focus。'\n694\t  - 'Strategy confusion matrix: 3 panels (Pythia/OLMo/GPT-2 XL)，展示 nucleus/topk50\n695\t    互混 + temp09 partial separability'\n696\t  analysis: \"Plan_017 将 Claim 3 从 \\\"solved deployment challenge\\\" reframe 为:\\n\\n\\\"\\\n697\t    We validate the two-stage decomposition principle: oracle two-stage (78.4%)\\n\\\n698\t    matches within-strategy performance (78.2%), confirming that cross-strategy\\n\\\n699\t    accuracy degradation (78.2% → 59.1%) is entirely attributable to strategy\\nmismatch.\\\n700\t    \\ Strategy identification from the same 19 depth features is the\\npractical bottleneck\\\n701\t    \\ (57.5%). Naive multi-strategy pooling (72.0%) serves as\\na strong zero-cost\\\n702\t    \\ baseline that improves over leave-one-strategy-out by 12.9pp.\\\"\\n\\n这个 reframe\\\n703\t    \\ 对 EMNLP 更有利：\\n1. \\\"Validated principle + identified bottleneck\\\" > \\\"solved\\\n704\t    \\ problem\\\" 作为 contribution\\n2. Oracle = within 是可量化的理论 claim\\n3. Bottleneck identification\\\n705\t    \\ 为 future work 指明方向（better strategy features,\\n   meta-learning, multi-task strategy-depth\\\n706\t    \\ joint classification）\\n4. Naive pooled 72.0% 是 practical takeaway\\n\\nPaper writing\\\n707\t    \\ 要点：\\n- 不能说 \\\"two-stage pipeline solves cross-strategy deployment\\\"\\n- 必须说 \\\"\\\n708\t    theoretical decomposition is validated, practical implementation limited\\n  by\\\n709\t    \\ strategy identification bottleneck\\\"\\n- Naive pooled 72.0% 是推荐 practical baseline\\n\\\n710\t    - Limitations: \\\"strategy identification accuracy (57.5%) is insufficient for\\n\\\n711\t    \\  the two-stage approach to outperform naive pooling; improving strategy\\n  classification\\\n712\t    \\ (e.g., via strategy-specific features or meta-learning)\\n  is identified as\\\n713\t    \\ a key open challenge\\\"\"\n714\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6588cd15-b944-4a4a-9536-76885190680c","uuid":"2d2999c2-129e-4a0d-a479-4672a82cfcf9","timestamp":"2026-05-17T08:49:59.593Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_2/projects/recursive_gen_depth_est/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T075852/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1: 条件性断言 — \"depth estimation is feasible and accurate at\n  1–1.5B (70–85%);\n\n  the signal persists at 14B (~67%) with ~13pp attenuation, and under prompted generation\n\n  (~67%) with ~16pp attenuation, indicating scale- and mode-dependent signal reduction\n\n  that warrants further investigation.\" Headline: \"70–85% at 1–1.5B; signal persists\n\n  at 14B (62–72%) and under topic-seeded generation (58–70%).\"\n\n\n  Claim 2: Atlas 9-cell 核心不变。14B 数据点扩展 scale 维度，EDD 从 1B 的 3–4 降至 14B\n\n  的 2（T=0.75），引入 scale-dependent EDD 概念——更大模型更快收敛到 attractor distribution。\n\n\n  Claim 3: 完全 reframe — \"we validate the two-stage decomposition principle: oracle\n\n  two-stage (78.4%) recovers within-strategy performance (78.2%), confirming strategy\n\n  conditioning as the theoretically correct approach. Strategy identification from\n  depth\n\n  features alone is the practical bottleneck (57.5%), and naive multi-strategy pooling\n\n  (72.0%) serves as a strong zero-cost baseline improving from 59.1%.\"\n\n\n  EMNLP Main: \"New Missions\" track — task formalization + comprehensive Atlas + scale/mode\n\n  robustness evidence (both positive AND honest attenuation reporting) + identified\n  open\n\n  challenges (strategy identification, prompted SNR, scale-dependent EDD).\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: DCOL Component Ablation (Cancelled)\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 'DCOL v6 各组件消融（attractive loss / repulsive loss / margin schedule /\n    embedding pooling）。前置依赖 plan_004 结论为 negative（test 64.5% vs RF 78.2%），实验取消。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: cancelled\n    reason: plan_004 (DCOL v6) negative — test_acc=64.5%, severe overfitting, 前置条件不满足\n    hypothetical_if_run:\n      attractive_only_acc: 0.58\n      repulsive_only_acc: 0.52\n      no_margin_schedule_acc: 0.61\n      full_model_acc: 0.645\n      best_ablation_vs_rf_gap_pp: -12\n      all_variants_overfit: true\n  result_rationale: 'DCOL 的根本失败是 representation bottleneck：RoBERTa-large [CLS] embedding\n    编码语义\n\n    内容而非 distributional depth signal。消融任一组件不改变此限制。attractive-only 去除\n\n    inter-class repulsion → embedding collapse（v1-v3 已验证此模式）；repulsive-only 丧失\n\n    ordinal structure → 退化为普通多类对比；no-margin-schedule 移除课程学习但 representation\n\n    quality 不变。所有变体均会在 train 75% vs val ~60-64% 处表现出严重过拟合——模型学到\n\n    training set 表面模式而非 generalizable depth signal。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '取消不影响论文。DCOL v6 negative result 纳入 Discussion 作为 \"contrastive ordinal\n    learning on text depth estimation 的固有局限\" 分析，增加论文诚实度。消融细节不需要。\n\n    '\n- name: 13B Clean FP16 Scale Validation\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-14B FP16 + LoRA（无量化），nucleus p=0.95，d0-d3 递归链，19 特征提取 + RF/LR\n    分类。Pythia-410M 作为 reference model。验证 depth signal 在主流规模是否持续。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    data:\n      model: Qwen2.5-14B\n      precision: FP16\n      quantization: none\n      strategy: nucleus_p095\n      depths: 4\n      samples_per_depth: 5000\n      reference_model: Pythia-410M\n      feature_dim: 19\n      truncation_length: 498\n    four_class:\n      rf_accuracy: 0.67\n      rf_accuracy_ci:\n      - 0.655\n      - 0.685\n      lr_accuracy: 0.63\n      lr_accuracy_ci:\n      - 0.614\n      - 0.646\n      mae: 0.38\n    pairwise_auc:\n      d0v1: 0.97\n      d0v2: 0.985\n      d0v3: 0.99\n      d1v2: 0.76\n      d1v3: 0.92\n      d2v3: 0.7\n    three_class:\n      rf_accuracy: 0.57\n      rf_accuracy_ci:\n      - 0.552\n      - 0.588\n      auc:\n        d1v2: 0.75\n        d1v3: 0.91\n        d2v3: 0.69\n    per_class:\n      d0:\n        recall: 0.96\n        precision: 0.88\n        f1: 0.92\n      d1:\n        recall: 0.68\n        precision: 0.62\n        f1: 0.65\n      d2:\n        recall: 0.42\n        precision: 0.52\n        f1: 0.46\n      d3:\n        recall: 0.62\n        precision: 0.7\n        f1: 0.66\n    edd_sensitivity:\n      T_080: 1\n      T_075: 2\n      T_070: 3\n      T_065: 3\n    top_features:\n      rank_1: p90_ppl\n      rank_2: mean_ppl\n      rank_3: var_surprisal\n      rank_4: p75_ppl\n      rank_5: mean_surprisal\n    feature_universality:\n      p90_ppl_in_top2: true\n      var_surprisal_in_top2: false\n      var_surprisal_in_top4: true\n      both_in_top5: true\n    finetune_losses:\n      depth_0: 1.65\n      depth_1: 1.15\n      depth_2: 0.9\n    code_contamination:\n      d0: 0.003\n      d1: 0.015\n      d2: 0.022\n      d3: 0.028\n    scale_comparison:\n      vs_1b_mean_nucleus_acc_delta_pp: -13.1\n      vs_1b_mean_d1v2_auc_delta: -0.12\n      vs_1b_edd_delta: -2 (from 3-4 to 2 at T=0.75)\n  result_rationale: '**4-class 67% (1B mean ~80%, Δ=-13pp)**:\n\n    14B 语言建模能力远超 1B，每次递归 fine-tune 产生的 distributional shift 更小。\n\n    14B 模型的 loss landscape 更平滑——同等 LoRA rank 的参数扰动对 14B output 分布的\n\n    影响被 14B 的大参数量\"稀释\"。结果是 d1 文本的 statistical properties 更接近 d0，\n\n    d1/d2/d3 在 feature space 中更紧凑。67% 仍远超 chance (25%)——信号存在但被压缩。\n\n\n    **d1v2 AUC 0.76 (1B mean ~0.88, Δ=-0.12)**:\n\n    d1→d2 是最关键的难点对。14B 模型在 d1 数据上 fine-tune 时，大容量让模型能\"吸收\"\n\n    训练数据变化而不显著改变生成行为——14B 有足够参数分配给 d1 分布的细微特征，同时保持\n\n    整体生成质量不变。这压缩了 d1/d2 feature space 间距。但 AUC>0.70 说明 boundary\n\n    仍然存在，不是随机水平。\n\n\n    **EDD=2 at T=0.75 (1B EDD=3-4)**:\n\n    这是最重要的 scale finding。14B 加速收敛到 attractor distribution：1B 模型需 3-4\n\n    次递归才到不可区分边界，14B 仅需 2 次。机制：更大模型的 attractor basin 更宽且\n\n    收敛梯度更陡，每步递归消除更大比例的 non-attractor distributional structure。\n\n    d2v3 AUC=0.70 恰在 T=0.75 下方——d2 和 d3 在 14B 上已几乎不可区分。\n\n    T=0.70 时 EDD=3 提供了对 threshold sensitivity 的有效展示。\n\n\n    **var_surprisal 从 rank 1-2 降至 rank 3**:\n\n    14B 生成文本在 token-level surprisal 上天然更一致（低方差），depth 间的 variance\n\n    差异被压缩。相比之下，p90_ppl 保持 top-2——极端 token 的 perplexity 在递归中\n\n    仍有可检测变化，因为即使 14B 也有 tail tokens 受递归 fine-tune 影响。mean_ppl\n\n    上升到 rank 2 因为 14B 文本的整体 perplexity 水平对 depth 的敏感度相对增强——\n\n    当 variance signal 被压缩时，mean level 成为主要鉴别器。\n\n\n    **Finetune losses 更低且间距更小 (d0=1.65→d1=1.15→d2=0.90)**:\n\n    14B 在原始数据上 loss 就更低（更好的 language model），递归间 loss drop 也更小\n\n    (Δd0d1=-0.50 vs 1B typical -0.60~-0.85)。这直接证实 distributional shift 被压缩。\n\n\n    **Pythia reference model 区分力衰减**:\n\n    Pythia-410M 看到的 14B 各 depth 输出的 perplexity 分布更接近 d0（因为 14B 生成\n\n    质量全面更接近 human text），depth 间的 feature distance 在 Pythia 视角下被压缩。\n\n    但 relative ordering 保持——d0<d1<d2<d3 in p90_ppl 的单调趋势仍在，只是间距变窄。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Scale Comparison — 3 个 1B 模型 (nucleus) vs 14B 的 4-class accuracy, d1v2/d2v3\n    AUC, EDD'\n  - 'Table: EDD Sensitivity — T=0.65/0.70/0.75/0.80 下的 EDD 值，1B (3 models) vs 14B'\n  - 'Table: Feature Importance Ranking — 1B pooled vs 14B，标注 rank shift'\n  - 'Table: Per-class Precision/Recall/F1 — 14B vs 1B best (GPT-2 XL nucleus)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'AUC decay curve: 3 条 1B 实线 + 1 条 14B 虚线。14B 线在 d1v2 处急剧下降，视觉化 scale-dependent\n    attenuation。加 EDD threshold 横线 (T=0.75)。'\n  - 'Confusion matrix heatmap pair: 14B (left) vs GPT-2 XL 1.5B (right)。14B 的 d1/d2\n    混淆区域显著扩大。'\n  - 'Feature importance bar chart: grouped bars (1B mean vs 14B)，标注 var_surprisal\n    rank shift (2→3) 和 mean_ppl rank shift (3-5→2)。'\n  analysis: '13B 结果是 median 叙事的核心支柱：signal persists with quantified attenuation。\n\n\n    对 Claim 1: \"at 1–1.5B, four-class accuracy reaches 70–85%; at 14B clean FP16,\n\n    accuracy is 67% (Δ≈−13pp), demonstrating that the depth signal persists at\n\n    mainstream model scale but with reduced discriminability.\" 不再说 \"robust across\n\n    scales\"，改为 \"signal persists with scale-dependent attenuation.\"\n\n\n    对 Claim 2 (Atlas): EDD scale-dependence (1B: 3-4, 14B: 2) 是独立 finding。\n\n    写入 Atlas section 作为 \"scale extension panel\"。EDD 公式从 EDD(M, S, T) 扩展为\n\n    EDD(M, S, T, |θ|)——depth boundary 是 model size 的函数。\n\n\n    对 Reviewer concern \"only tested on small models\": 直接回应——14B clean FP16\n\n    实验确认信号存在，衰减幅度精确量化。这比 \"signal disappears at scale\" 或\n\n    \"signal is identical at scale\" 都更 informative 且更诚实。\n\n\n    Feature universality claim 需限定: \"p90_ppl and var_surprisal consistently appear\n\n    in the top-5 across all settings including 14B, though their relative ranking\n\n    shifts at larger scale (var_surprisal drops from top-2 to top-4 at 14B).\"\n\n    '\n- name: Wild-data Calibration on RedPajama/Dolma\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: '在 RedPajama 和 Dolma 上运行已训练的 depth classifier，评估 FPR 和跨语料一致性。 已延后到\n    AAAI 窗口，不阻塞 EMNLP 投稿。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: deferred_to_aaai\n    redpajama:\n      n_passages: 5000\n      d0_pct: 80.0\n      d1_pct: 15.2\n      d2_pct: 3.3\n      d3_pct: 1.5\n      fpr: 20.0\n      mean_p_d0: 0.78\n    dolma:\n      n_passages: 5000\n      d0_pct: 85.0\n      d1_pct: 11.0\n      d2_pct: 2.5\n      d3_pct: 1.5\n      fpr: 15.0\n      mean_p_d0: 0.82\n      per_source_fpr:\n        wiki_subset: 1.0\n        academic_subset: 3.0\n        books_subset: 2.0\n        web_subset: 20.0\n    cross_corpus_pattern:\n      editorial_fpr_range: 0–3%\n      curated_web_fpr_range: 12–18%\n      raw_webcrawl_fpr_range: 18–22%\n      six_corpus_summary: FPR 由内容质量驱动，非 dataset-specific artifact\n  result_rationale: '**RedPajama FPR ~20%**: RedPajama-v2 与 C4 同为 Common Crawl 子集\n    + 质量过滤，数据\n\n    组成高度重叠。已有三个 web-crawl 数据集 FPR 一致 (C4=20.2%, FineWeb=19.5%,\n\n    RedPajama_sample≈20%)，表明 ~20% 是 web-crawl 内容中 template/SEO/boilerplate 的\n\n    固有比例——这些文本的高重复率和低词汇多样性使其 feature profile 酷似 d1+ 生成文本。\n\n\n    **Dolma FPR ~15%**: Dolma 由 AI2 策划，包含高质量子集（Wikipedia, books, academic\n\n    papers）和 web 子集。Wikipedia 类内容 FPR ≈ 0% (WikiText 验证), academic/books 约\n\n    2-3%，web 子集约 20%。混合后整体 ~15%，低于纯 web-crawl 但高于纯 editorial。\n\n\n    **Cross-corpus 一致性**: 4 个已有数据点已建立清晰模式——FPR 与数据质量强相关，与数据\n\n    来源弱相关。RedPajama/Dolma 不会打破此规律，只会增加模式的统计确信度。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table (Appendix): FPR across 6+ corpora — WikiText/OpenWebText/C4/FineWeb/RedPajama/Dolma，按质量层级排列'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: FPR by corpus, 分三组 (editorial ≤3% / curated-web 12-18% / raw-web-crawl\n    18-22%)'\n  analysis: '延后不影响 EMNLP。当前 4 个数据点 (WikiText 0% / OpenWebText ~1-3% / C4 ~20% /\n\n    FineWeb ~19.5%) 已足够支撑 \"FPR is content-quality-driven\" 论述。\n\n    RedPajama/Dolma 增加密度但不改变结论。AAAI 版本可加入作为 extended analysis。\n\n    '\n- name: Prompted Generation Ecological Validity\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: 'GPT-2 XL topic-seeded d0-d3 递归链。用 ~10 个 topic prompt 前缀替代 BOS 无条件生成，\n    验证 depth signal 是否为无条件生成的 artifact。d0 = base GPT-2 XL 有 prompt 生成， d1-d3 = 递归\n    LoRA fine-tune 后有 prompt 生成。Pythia-410M 为 reference model。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    data:\n      model: GPT-2 XL (1.5B)\n      strategy: nucleus_p095\n      generation_mode: topic-seeded\n      prompt_templates: 10\n      depths: 4\n      samples_per_depth: 5000\n      reference_model: Pythia-410M\n    four_class:\n      rf_accuracy: 0.67\n      rf_accuracy_ci:\n      - 0.654\n      - 0.686\n      lr_accuracy: 0.62\n      lr_accuracy_ci:\n      - 0.603\n      - 0.637\n      mae: 0.37\n    pairwise_auc:\n      d0v1: 0.98\n      d0v2: 0.993\n      d0v3: 0.997\n      d1v2: 0.76\n      d1v3: 0.94\n      d2v3: 0.72\n    three_class:\n      rf_accuracy: 0.58\n      rf_accuracy_ci:\n      - 0.561\n      - 0.599\n      auc:\n        d1v2: 0.75\n        d1v3: 0.93\n        d2v3: 0.71\n    per_class:\n      d0:\n        recall: 0.95\n        precision: 0.88\n        f1: 0.91\n      d1:\n        recall: 0.7\n        precision: 0.64\n        f1: 0.67\n      d2:\n        recall: 0.45\n        precision: 0.5\n        f1: 0.47\n      d3:\n        recall: 0.58\n        precision: 0.68\n        f1: 0.63\n    retention_vs_bos:\n      bos_baseline_acc: 0.833\n      prompted_acc: 0.67\n      retention_pct: 80.4\n      bos_d1v2_auc: 0.913\n      prompted_d1v2_auc: 0.76\n      d1v2_retention_pct: 83.2\n      bos_d2v3_auc: 0.883\n      prompted_d2v3_auc: 0.72\n      d2v3_retention_pct: 81.5\n    edd_at_075: 2\n    top_features:\n      rank_1: p90_ppl\n      rank_2: var_surprisal\n      rank_3: p75_ppl\n      rank_4: mean_ppl\n      rank_5: mean_surprisal\n    feature_importance_vs_bos:\n      p90_ppl_weight_ratio: 0.85\n      var_surprisal_weight_ratio: 0.78\n      ranking_preserved: true\n      importance_uniformly_attenuated: true\n    finetune_losses:\n      depth_0: 2.3\n      depth_1: 1.55\n      depth_2: 1.2\n    code_contamination:\n      d0: 0.001\n      d1: 0.008\n      d2: 0.015\n      d3: 0.02\n  result_rationale: '**4-class 67% (BOS 83.3%, Δ=-16.3pp, retention 80%)**:\n\n    Topic seed 引入内容先验，约束了模型生成的词汇和主题范围。BOS 模式下，不同 depth\n\n    的文本在 topic coverage、lexical diversity 上差异显著（depth↑ → topic collapse →\n\n    TTR 下降）。Topic-seeded 模式下所有 depth 都围绕指定主题生成，topic collapse 信号\n\n    被部分掩盖，词汇多样性差异缩小。\n\n\n    但 80% retention 揭示信号的主要来源不是 topic-level diversity 而是 token-level\n\n    distributional shift：prompt 约束了\"说什么\"但不约束\"怎么说\"——递归 fine-tune\n\n    改变的是模型的 logit distribution over tokens，这在任何生成模式下都会发生。\n\n    p90_ppl 和 var_surprisal 捕获的正是这种 token-level 变化。\n\n\n    **d1v2 AUC 0.76 (BOS 0.913, Δ=-0.153)**:\n\n    Topic prompt 充当 regularizer：conditioned generation 使 fine-tune 后模型在\n\n    topic-relevant context 中的行为更接近 pre-tune 模型（prompt 约束减少了 generation\n\n    自由度，限制了 distributional shift 的表达空间）。d1/d2 的 feature space 间距\n\n    缩小，但 AUC>0.65 说明 boundary 仍 detectable，不是 noise。\n\n\n    **Feature ranking 保持 (p90_ppl > var_surprisal)**:\n\n    Perplexity tail statistics 是最 mode-robust 的 depth marker。Topic prompt 降低了\n\n    所有 depth 的 overall generation variance，但 tail events（extreme tokens）的\n\n    depth-dependent behavior 难以被 topic constraint 完全消除——即使在受限主题内，\n\n    递归 fine-tune 仍改变模型对 low-frequency tokens 的概率分配。Importance weights\n\n    整体下降约 15-22%（与 accuracy drop 一致），但 rank ordering 稳定。\n\n\n    **Feature importance attenuation 但非 collapse (weight ratio 0.78-0.85)**:\n\n    说明 topic prompt 均匀压缩了所有 depth features 的区分力，而非选择性消除某些\n\n    features。这支持 \"same underlying signal, different SNR\" 的叙事——BOS 和 prompted\n\n    共享同一 depth signal，只是 prompted 的 signal-to-noise ratio 更低。\n\n\n    **EDD=2 at T=0.75**:\n\n    Prompted 模式下 d2/d3 变得难以区分。机制与 13B 不同——不是模型容量导致的快速收敛，\n\n    而是 topic constraint 压缩了 feature space 中 d2/d3 微弱差异的可见度。两个独立\n\n    原因（scale 和 mode）导致相同 EDD=2，是巧合而非因果关联。\n\n\n    **Finetune losses (d0=2.30, d1=1.55, d2=1.20)**:\n\n    d0 loss 比 BOS (2.55) 略低：topic-seeded text 更结构化、更可预测。但 depth 间\n\n    loss gap 模式保持 (d0-d1=-0.75, d1-d2=-0.35)，说明递归 degradation 的基本\n\n    dynamics 不受 generation mode 影响。\n\n\n    **Code contamination 极低 (<2%)**:\n\n    Topic-seeded 生成约束内容为自然语言主题（\"The following article discusses...\"等），\n\n    几乎不产生代码。低于 BOS 模式的 code contamination。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: BOS vs Prompted — 4-class accuracy, d1v2/d2v3 AUC, retention rates'\n  - 'Table: Per-class Recall/Precision/F1 — BOS vs Prompted side-by-side'\n  - 'Table: Feature importance ranking + weights — BOS vs Prompted, with attenuation\n    ratio'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar chart: BOS vs Prompted per-metric (acc, d1v2 AUC, d2v3 AUC)，每对 bars\n    上方标注 retention %'\n  - 'Feature trajectory panel: top-5 features × depth, BOS (solid line) vs Prompted\n    (dashed line)，展示平行衰减 + 幅度压缩'\n  analysis: 'Prompted 实验提供 \"partial ecological validation\":\n\n    - 67% > 25% (chance) → 信号不是 BOS artifact\n\n    - 80% retention → 信号大部分保留\n\n    - Feature ranking 不变 → 同一底层 signal，不同 SNR\n\n\n    对 Claim 1: \"under prompted (topic-seeded) generation, depth estimation retains\n\n    ~80% of BOS baseline accuracy (67% vs 83.3%), confirming the depth signal\n\n    reflects genuine distributional shifts from recursive fine-tuning rather than\n\n    an artifact of unconditional generation mode.\"\n\n\n    对 Reviewer concern \"artifact of BOS\": 直接回应——67% far above chance, signal\n\n    exists under realistic conditions. 但需诚实报告 16pp gap 并写入 Limitations:\n\n    \"prompted generation attenuates the signal; whether prompt diversity, longer\n\n    generation, or alternative prompt strategies could recover accuracy remains open.\"\n\n\n    Key narrative: \"BOS-seeded and topic-seeded generation share the same underlying\n\n    depth signal with different SNR — the signal arises from recursive fine-tuning\n\n    dynamics, not from generation mode artifacts.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Strategy Two-Stage Pipeline\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: '两阶段方案：(a) 策略识别分类器（19 features → 3-class: nucleus/temp09/topk50）， (b)\n    策略条件深度分类器（识别后用策略专属 RF）。含 oracle two-stage / naive pooled / within-strategy 对照。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    strategy_classification:\n      mean_acc: 0.575\n      chance: 0.333\n      pythia:\n        acc: 0.523\n        per_strategy_recall:\n          nucleus: 0.533\n          temp09: 0.414\n          topk50: 0.622\n      olmo:\n        acc: 0.548\n        per_strategy_recall:\n          nucleus: 0.608\n          temp09: 0.479\n          topk50: 0.558\n      gpt2xl:\n        acc: 0.654\n        per_strategy_recall:\n          nucleus: 0.845\n          temp09: 0.507\n          topk50: 0.61\n      confusion_pattern: nucleus/topk50 互混最严重（均为 truncation-based），temp09 相对可区分但 recall\n        仍低于 60%\n    depth_estimation_ladder:\n      cross_strategy_loo_ref: 0.591\n      naive_pooled:\n        pythia: 0.709\n        olmo: 0.712\n        gpt2xl: 0.739\n        mean: 0.72\n      predicted_two_stage:\n        pythia: 0.693\n        olmo: 0.695\n        gpt2xl: 0.73\n        mean: 0.706\n      oracle_two_stage:\n        pythia: 0.746\n        olmo: 0.785\n        gpt2xl: 0.82\n        mean: 0.784\n      within_strategy_ref:\n        pythia: 0.745\n        olmo: 0.784\n        gpt2xl: 0.816\n        mean: 0.782\n    key_gaps_pp:\n      oracle_vs_within: 0.2\n      predicted_vs_naive: -1.4\n      predicted_vs_oracle: -7.8\n      naive_vs_cross_loo: 12.9\n    strategy_clf_breakeven_estimate: 65-70% strategy accuracy needed for two-stage\n      > naive pooled\n  result_rationale: '**策略分类 57.5% (预期 >90% 未达成)**:\n\n    原始预期基于 \"三种策略的 feature distribution 高度可分\" 的假设——此假设错误。\n\n    19 个 features 主要编码 depth signal 而非 strategy signal：p90_ppl 和 var_surprisal\n\n    的值主要由 depth 决定，strategy 效应是二阶效应。\n\n\n    具体原因：nucleus p=0.95 和 topk k=50 都是 truncation-based sampling，两者截断\n\n    低概率 token 来控制质量，产生高度相似的 feature distribution。只有 temp09（uniform\n\n    logit scaling 而非截断）产生显著不同的 feature profile。但 temp09 的区分性集中在\n\n    d1-d2 boundary 附近（即 d1v2 AUC 反转现象），在 d0 和 d3 处三种策略的 feature\n\n    values 收敛（d0 是 real text → strategy-independent，d3 已深度退化 → 策略差异被\n\n    attractor convergence 淹没）。\n\n\n    GPT-2 XL 策略分类最优 (65.4%)：GPT-2 XL 的 strategy-feature interaction 最强\n\n    (d1v2 AUC: nucleus 0.913 vs temp09 0.937 → 跨策略差异最显著)。Pythia 最差 (52.3%)\n\n    因为其三种策略 feature distribution 最接近。\n\n\n    **Oracle two-stage (78.4%) ≈ within-strategy (78.2%), gap=0.2pp**:\n\n    最重要的理论验证。当策略已知时，strategy-conditioned classifier 完美恢复\n\n    within-strategy 性能，0.2pp 在统计误差内。这证明 cross-strategy accuracy drop\n\n    (78.2% → 59.1% = -19.1pp) 完全由 strategy mismatch 驱动，无其他 confound。\n\n    Two-stage decomposition 在理论上是完全正确的分解。\n\n\n    **Predicted two-stage (70.6%) < naive pooled (72.0%), Δ=-1.4pp**:\n\n    策略分类器 57.5% 意味着 ~42.5% 样本被路由到错误的 strategy-conditioned classifier。\n\n    错误路由的损害大于正确路由的收益——被错误分配到 temp09 classifier 的 nucleus 样本\n\n    会遭遇 d1v2 boundary 反转（AUC<0.20），产生系统性误分类。Naive pooled 通过在\n\n    全部训练数据上训练单一 RF 来\"平均化\"策略差异，避免了路由错误，反而更稳定。\n\n\n    **Naive pooled (72.0%) vs cross-LOO (59.1%), Δ=+12.9pp**:\n\n    Pooled 至少见过所有策略的训练数据，相当于 \"strategy-agnostic\" method。LOO 完全\n\n    没有 holdout strategy 的数据，尤其在 temp09-holdout 场景下遭遇灾难性的 d1v2 反转。\n\n    +12.9pp 说明\"简单池化\"是一个 strong, zero-cost baseline。\n\n\n    **Breakeven 估计 65-70%**:\n\n    当策略分类 accuracy 超过 ~65-70% 时，正确路由的收益开始超过错误路由的损害。这是\n\n    因为正确路由到 within-strategy classifier 的样本每个贡献 +6pp (78.2% - 72.0%)\n\n    的潜在增益，而错误路由平均贡献 -13pp 的损害 (72.0% - 59.1%)。在 p(correct)\n\n    × 6 > p(error) × 13 即 p>0.68 时，two-stage 优于 pooled。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Strategy Classification — per-model accuracy + per-strategy recall + confusion\n    matrix'\n  - 'Table: Depth Estimation Accuracy Ladder — 5 conditions (LOO 59.1% → Pooled 72.0%\n    → Predicted 70.6% → Oracle 78.4% → Within 78.2%) per model + mean'\n  - 'Table: Gap Analysis — oracle-within, predicted-pooled, predicted-oracle, pooled-LOO,\n    with interpretation'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Accuracy ladder bar chart: 5 bars 从左到右 (LOO → Pooled → Predicted → Oracle → Within)，用括号标注\n    key gaps。Oracle/Within 几乎等高是视觉 focus。'\n  - 'Strategy confusion matrix: 3 panels (Pythia/OLMo/GPT-2 XL)，展示 nucleus/topk50\n    互混 + temp09 partial separability'\n  analysis: \"Plan_017 将 Claim 3 从 \\\"solved deployment challenge\\\" reframe 为:\\n\\n\\\"\\\n    We validate the two-stage decomposition principle: oracle two-stage (78.4%)\\n\\\n    matches within-strategy performance (78.2%), confirming that cross-strategy\\n\\\n    accuracy degradation (78.2% → 59.1%) is entirely attributable to strategy\\nmismatch.\\\n    \\ Strategy identification from the same 19 depth features is the\\npractical bottleneck\\\n    \\ (57.5%). Naive multi-strategy pooling (72.0%) serves as\\na strong zero-cost\\\n    \\ baseline that improves over leave-one-strategy-out by 12.9pp.\\\"\\n\\n这个 reframe\\\n    \\ 对 EMNLP 更有利：\\n1. \\\"Validated principle + identified bottleneck\\\" > \\\"solved\\\n    \\ problem\\\" 作为 contribution\\n2. Oracle = within 是可量化的理论 claim\\n3. Bottleneck identification\\\n    \\ 为 future work 指明方向（better strategy features,\\n   meta-learning, multi-task strategy-depth\\\n    \\ joint classification）\\n4. Naive pooled 72.0% 是 practical takeaway\\n\\nPaper writing\\\n    \\ 要点：\\n- 不能说 \\\"two-stage pipeline solves cross-strategy deployment\\\"\\n- 必须说 \\\"\\\n    theoretical decomposition is validated, practical implementation limited\\n  by\\\n    \\ strategy identification bottleneck\\\"\\n- Naive pooled 72.0% 是推荐 practical baseline\\n\\\n    - Limitations: \\\"strategy identification accuracy (57.5%) is insufficient for\\n\\\n    \\  the two-stage approach to outperform naive pooling; improving strategy\\n  classification\\\n    \\ (e.g., via strategy-specific features or meta-learning)\\n  is identified as\\\n    \\ a key open challenge\\\"\"\n","numLines":714,"startLine":1,"totalLines":714}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PsgPBi81mNpBnE3D3p7ZPp","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"EMNLP 2026 reviewer guidelines review form\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"FAQ - EMNLP 2026\",\"url\":\"https://2026.emnlp.org/faq/\"},{\"title\":\"LINGUIST List 37.972 Confs: 2026 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (Hungary)\",\"url\":\"https://linguistlist.org/issues/37/972/\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP 2026 : The 2026 Conference on Empirical Methods in N\",\"url\":\"https://callforpaper.org/call-for-papers-emnlp-2026\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP 2026 | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP%2F2026\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP\"},{\"title\":\"Authors Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/authors\"},{\"title\":\"Changes to reviewer volunteering requirement and incentives in May 2025 cycle (EMNLP 2025)\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/incentives2025\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP 2025 (@emnlpmeeting) · X\",\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/emnlpmeeting\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP: Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing 2027 2026 2025 ...\",\"url\":\"http://www.wikicfp.com/cfp/program?id=883\"},{\"title\":\"[EMNLP 2025] First Call for Papers | ACL Member Portal\",\"url\":\"https://www.aclweb.org/portal/content/emnlp-2025-first-call-papers\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, I found some relevant information about EMNLP 2026:\n\nEMNLP 2026 uses the Open Review platform for submissions, where authors first submit articles to ARR (ACL Rolling Review) to receive reviews and meta-reviews from ARR reviewers and action editors, and then commit their reviewed articles to EMNLP 2026 where Senior Area Chairs and Program Chairs make acceptance decisions.\n\nRegarding reviewer timelines: If you receive review assignments, your reviews must be completed by July 6, or your meta-reviews by July 29.\n\nHowever, the search results don't contain a specific link to a detailed reviewer guidelines document or review form template for EMNLP 2026. For comprehensive reviewer guidelines and the actual review form, I'd recommend:\n\n1. Visiting the EMNLP 2026 official website at https://2026.emnlp.org/\n2. Checking the ACL Rolling Review (ARR) website at http://aclrollingreview.org, which provides reviewer guidance and forms\n3. Looking at the OpenReview platform directly at https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP%2F2026\n\nThe reviewer guidelines and review form are typically made available once you're assigned as a reviewer in the system.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6588cd15-b944-4a4a-9536-76885190680c","uuid":"3d5c03c8-d357-4745-b19a-b2a622a36701","timestamp":"2026-05-17T08:50:00.977Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"EMNLP 2026 reviewer guidelines review form","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_012FdbRnDbUZuCAHU2PUJUpS","content":[{"title":"FAQ - EMNLP 2026","url":"https://2026.emnlp.org/faq/"},{"title":"LINGUIST List 37.972 Confs: 2026 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (Hungary)","url":"https://linguistlist.org/issues/37/972/"},{"title":"EMNLP 2026 : The 2026 Conference on Empirical Methods in N","url":"https://callforpaper.org/call-for-papers-emnlp-2026"},{"title":"EMNLP 2026 | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP%2F2026"},{"title":"EMNLP | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP"},{"title":"Authors Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/authors"},{"title":"Changes to reviewer volunteering requirement and incentives in May 2025 cycle (EMNLP 2025)","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/incentives2025"},{"title":"EMNLP 2025 (@emnlpmeeting) · X","url":"https://twitter.com/emnlpmeeting"},{"title":"EMNLP: Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing 2027 2026 2025 ...","url":"http://www.wikicfp.com/cfp/program?id=883"},{"title":"[EMNLP 2025] First Call for Papers | ACL Member Portal","url":"https://www.aclweb.org/portal/content/emnlp-2025-first-call-papers"}]},"Based on the web search results, I found some relevant information about EMNLP 2026:\n\nEMNLP 2026 uses the Open Review platform for submissions, where authors first submit articles to ARR (ACL Rolling Review) to receive reviews and meta-reviews from ARR reviewers and action editors, and then commit their reviewed articles to EMNLP 2026 where Senior Area Chairs and Program Chairs make acceptance decisions.\n\nRegarding reviewer timelines: If you receive review assignments, your reviews must be completed by July 6, or your meta-reviews by July 29.\n\nHowever, the search results don't contain a specific link to a detailed reviewer guidelines document or review form template for EMNLP 2026. For comprehensive reviewer guidelines and the actual review form, I'd recommend:\n\n1. Visiting the EMNLP 2026 official website at https://2026.emnlp.org/\n2. Checking the ACL Rolling Review (ARR) website at http://aclrollingreview.org, which provides reviewer guidance and forms\n3. Looking at the OpenReview platform directly at https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP%2F2026\n\nThe reviewer guidelines and review form are typically made available once you're assigned as a reviewer in the system."],"durationSeconds":5.220216564000002}}
