{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Rt2FnoTLpEUs2dSN7o4gZm","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_2/projects/recursive_gen_depth_est/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-17\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| cross_strategy_pipeline_001 | Strategy classifier achieves >90% accuracy on 19 statistical features; two-stage pipeline (predict strategy then route to per-strategy depth RF) recovers cross-strategy depth accuracy to >=70% vs naive LOO 59.1% | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **gen_length_ablation_001** (negative): Depth signal scales with passage length: 128-token passages are detectable but weaker; 512-token passages match 256-token baseline; cross-length accuracy spread ≤ 5pp ← 基于 mvp_pipeline_pythia_002\\\\n- **cross_seed_transfer_001** (success): If depth signal is an inherent property of recursive generation, an RF trained on seed=42 features should generalize to seed=43 features with cross-seed acc ≥ 75% (Δ ≤ 3pp vs within-seed) ← 基于 second_seed_replication_001\\\\n- **mixed_depth_corpus_001** (negative): RF per-sample classifier does not rely on corpus-level depth distribution prior; accuracy on mixed-depth corpus (50/30/15/5%) should match balanced baseline within Δ ≤ 2pp ← 基于 baseline_battery_001\\\\n  [mixed_depth_corpus_summary](/api/workspace-files/projects/recursive_gen_depth_est/artifacts/mixed_depth_corpus_001/data/summary.txt)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 53 / 负向 9 / 失败 10 / 共 87\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\ngpu-6000pro-2: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_003: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_004: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_